@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Feature Specification: Task timestamps
+
+**Input**: Record when each task was created and last changed.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: Every task MUST have `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings.
+- **FR-002**: When added, `createdAt` equals `updatedAt`.
+- **FR-003**: complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag MUST set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes.
+- **FR-004**: The domain MUST NOT read the clock (constitution): the list takes a clock function; `createTodoList` defaults it to the system time.
+
+## Assumptions
+- A failed change (e.g. completing a done task) is not a change: `updatedAt` stays.
+- Tagging with a tag already present still counts as a change attempt and sets `updatedAt`.
